 	them through this module, which does it under one lock.
 
 	The indexes in use: 0x4e (the frame buffer, U-Boot's choice) and
-	0x60-0x63 (the video layer) by meson_hdmi; 0x80-0xbf by meson_vdec.
+	0x60-0x63 (the video layer) by meson_hdmi; 0x80-0xbf by meson_vdec;
